        <mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;b&gt;Validasi sistem&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Harus angka, maksimal 2 desimal.&lt;br&gt;• Rentang: Emergency 1–30 hari kerja; jadwal −100 s.d. 0 poin; biaya 1–1000%.&lt;br&gt;• Pasangan konsisten: On Track jadwal &amp;gt; Slightly Delay; rasio On Track biaya &amp;lt; At Risk.&lt;br&gt;• Default: Emergency 3 · jadwal −5 / −15 · biaya 100% / 110%." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
